@Demo.Idempotent.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5104

### 首次创建
POST {{Demo.Idempotent.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-001
Accept: application/json

{
  "product": "键盘",
  "quantity": 2
}

### 相同 Key + 相同 Body → 回放首次结果
POST {{Demo.Idempotent.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-001
Accept: application/json

{
  "product": "键盘",
  "quantity": 2
}

### 相同 Key + 空白/字段顺序差异 → 仍回放（属性名排序后再哈希）
POST {{Demo.Idempotent.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-001
Accept: application/json

{"quantity":2,"product":"键盘"}

### 相同 Key + 不同 Body → 409
POST {{Demo.Idempotent.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-001
Accept: application/json

{
  "product": "鼠标",
  "quantity": 1
}

### 并发同 Key：唯一约束冲突后回放首次结果（订单+幂等同事务）
# 快速连发同一 Key；后到者应拿到与成功者相同的订单 Id

### TTL 过期后
# 幂等行作废，历史订单保留；同 Key 可再建一笔新订单（非删除旧单）

### 缺少 Idempotency-Key → 400
POST {{Demo.Idempotent.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "product": "键盘",
  "quantity": 2
}

###
GET {{Demo.Idempotent.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json
